{
  "schema": "lgpe-gamedata-v1",
  "format": "LGPE-message",
  "lines": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "id": "msg_main0940_rocketboss_01",
      "hash": "13ec62a8c0b49f03",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "GIOVANNI: Now, now, Mr. President.\\nI hope you’re not thinking of lying to me."
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "id": "msg_main0940_rocketboss_06",
      "hash": "13ec67a8c0b4a782",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "The Master Ball...\\c\\nYou successfully created one, didn’t you!"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "id": "msg_main0940_president_01",
      "hash": "578d27f5487e1a18",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "PRESIDENT: Do you think it’s that easy\\nto make?"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "id": "msg_main0940_president_04",
      "hash": "578d2cf5487e2297",
      "flags": 4,
      "text": "And now that I know who you really are, there\\nis no way I want to make a thing like that...\\r\\nNot for someone like you!"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "id": "msg_main0940_rocketboss_02",
      "hash": "13ec63a8c0b4a0b6",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "GIOVANNI: How dare you?!"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "id": "msg_main0940_president_02",
      "hash": "578d2af5487e1f31",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "PRESIDENT: And give up any thought of forcing\\nus to create lots of powerful Pokémon for you!"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "id": "msg_main0940_president_05",
      "hash": "578d2bf5487e20e4",
      "flags": 4,
      "text": "Using stolen research to create Pokémon...\\nThat’s not something Silph should ever do."
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "id": "msg_main0940_rocketboss_03",
      "hash": "13ec64a8c0b4a269",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "GIOVANNI: We had a deal! You agreed to this!"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "id": "msg_main0940_rocketboss_12",
      "hash": "13ef65a8c0b6d9f3",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "...You’re a smart man. I’m sure you can imagine\\nwhat will happen to your people if you say no\\r\\nto me now."
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "id": "msg_main0940_president_03",
      "hash": "578d29f5487e1d7e",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "PRESIDENT: ..."
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "id": "msg_main0940_rocketboss_04",
      "hash": "13ec65a8c0b4a41c",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "GIOVANNI: Ah. Young [VAR TRNAME(0000)].\\nSo we meet again!\\c\\nThe president of Silph and I are discussing\\na vital business proposition.\\c\\nKeep your nose out of grown-up matters..."
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "id": "msg_main0940_rocketboss_07",
      "hash": "13ec68a8c0b4a935",
      "flags": 4,
      "text": "Or experience a world of pain!"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "id": "msg_main0940_dummy_01",
      "hash": "1ae20b304fe2d1a8",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 12]"
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "id": "msg_main0940_rocketboss_05",
      "hash": "13ec66a8c0b4a5cf",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "GIOVANNI: Blast... I have little choice, it seems.\\nI will relinquish Silph for now."
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "id": "msg_main0940_rocketboss_08",
      "hash": "13ec69a8c0b4aae8",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "But Team Rocket will never fall!"
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "id": "msg_main0940_rocketboss_09",
      "hash": "13ec6aa8c0b4ac9b",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0000)]! Never forget..."
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "id": "msg_main0940_rocketboss_10",
      "hash": "13ef67a8c0b6dd59",
      "flags": 4,
      "text": "All Pokémon exist for Team Rocket’s use!"
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "id": "msg_main0940_rocketboss_11",
      "hash": "13ef66a8c0b6dba6",
      "flags": 4,
      "text": "I may leave you now, but we will meet again!"
    }
  ],
  "unpaired_labels": [
    {
      "id": "msg_main_event_0940_max",
      "hash": "3aa8d0ca74782e2c"
    }
  ]
}
